"P1045950724" "{PERSON_NAME} told you:<br><br>'I swear, I never meant to get involved with the Council! I was just writing an article on the Paragon City government, and I guess I asked too many questions about the wrong officials! One of their officers came to see me last night; he said I could join them or die! <br><br>They were planning to take me to a big training base right here in Atlas Park. There may be other people there who the Council recruited against their will!'"

